{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race across the endless dunes in SANDSPEED: CAMEL RACING, an action camel racing game where speed and skill determine the champion! Compete in high-speed races and challenging time trials, push your camel to the limit as you dash through desertic landscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why play SANDSPEED:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's not about horsepower, It's about camelpower:</strong> Compete against swift rivals or test your reflexes in time-based challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sweet &quot;Super&quot; Sweet Watermelons:</strong> Snag juicy speed boosts by collecting watermelons on the track.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Desert:</strong> Dodge hazards and conquer shifting terrain to stay ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feel the Thrill:</strong> Experience immersive desert-themed music and realistic racing sound effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock &amp; Explore:</strong> Earn achievements, unlock new tracks, and uncover hidden surprises as you climb the tournament.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to dominate the dunes and become the ultimate camel racing champion? The race is on!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Stone cup","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635820/437f922b2b6cb328830d78e2fc095f5f0d4571e9.jpg"},{"name":"Quartz cup","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635820/c1839f91955cc21db3b9c622e9c650842bac6c38.jpg"},{"name":"Amethyst cup","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635820/8e9535782a5e3416f000017a9c6954cd8754b2e6.jpg"},{"name":"Topaz Cup","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635820/5f48125d727d51c62d8fa5cd740cbf55e407ff3